results/models/

# Figures are regenerated from the published records by src/make_paper_figures.py.
results/figures/

# WHICH RESULT RECORDS ARE PUBLISHED HERE, and why the list is explicit.
#
# The manuscript reports 652 runs and promises each one resolves to a file in
# this release. All four sets below are therefore published, and none of them
# may be folded back into a blanket results/metrics* exclusion:
#
#   results/grid/          200 lightweight cells, 300k subsample
#   results/grid_deep/      40 deep tabular cells, 300k subsample
#   results/grid_full_1m/   12 full 1.21M verification runs
#   results/decomposition/ 400 composition and prior-control cells
#
# The deep tabular and full-scale sets are the ones an earlier release of this
# study left out, which stranded its own claim about seven model families.
# scripts/count_runs.py recounts all four and fails if the total moves.

